
### 1. CREATE a new task  (expect: 201 Created)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Buy groceries",
    "description": "Milk, eggs, bread",
    "dueDate": "2026-08-20"
}

### 2. CREATE a task with NO title -> should FAIL (expect: 400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "description": "This task has no title, it should be rejected"
}

### 3. GET ALL tasks  (expect: 200 OK, JSON array)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks

### 4. GET only COMPLETED tasks  (expect: 200 OK, filtered array)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks?completed=true

### 5. GET ONE task by ID  (expect: 200 OK)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6a8325829dc6e0f1af42bbcb

### 6. GET ONE task with a FAKE ID -> should FAIL (expect: 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/000000000000000000000000

### 7. UPDATE a task (PUT)  (expect: 200 OK, isCompleted now true)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6a8325829dc6e0f1af42bbcb
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "isCompleted": true
}

### 8. UPDATE a task (PATCH) - partial update  (expect: 200 OK)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6a8325829dc6e0f1af42bbcb
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "description": "Updated description only"
}

### 9. DELETE a task  (expect: 200 OK, success message)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6a8325829dc6e0f1af42bbcb

### 10. GET the deleted task again -> should FAIL (expect: 404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/6a8325829dc6e0f1af42bbcb